      "writtenOn": "2025-11-20T14:55:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I though the erratas as tied to the `Cpu`s and not to the `Platform`. Wasn\u0027t this the plan that we came up with in October?",
      "revId": "d74ff43038923705ec16efe5d6f2dea1fd6bd441",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
